      "displayName": "Bill Branan",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5d83b5f927bbf40c2c32ceeb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>From Aaron:</p>\n\n<p>The latest version of MPTStore is 0.9.3, which is what is in the oaiprovider.  0.9.3 differs from 0.9.1 (the version currently being used in trippi) only in its complex query functionality, which isn't expressed in a language that trippi exposes. The oaiprovider service uses the MPTStore lib directly (no trippi), so 0.9.3 is truly needed there.  </p>\n\n<p>So.. the following items should be done:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>do a 0.9.3 release packaging of mptstore</li>\n\t<li>put 0.9.3 in trippi</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "29/Oct/08 1:53 PM",
     "id": "10783",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10199/comment/10783",
